 written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Expressing Necessity", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d is used to express necessity.<br /> \u201cGoing to have to\u201d expresses a necessary action in the future or a condition.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d has irregular forms in the past and future. Look at the chart below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>I/You/We/They</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have got</span> to<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">'ve got</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>He/She</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has got</span> to<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">'s got</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ will + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have</span> + to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Examples:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I've got to save money.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I had to live on a tight budget.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I will have to watch my spending habits.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You use \"<span class=\"strong\">Don't have to</span>\" or \"<span class=\"strong\">Doesn't have to</span>\" to express what is not necessary. <br/>Remember to use a verb in its base form after \"<span class=\"strong\">Don't</span>/<span class=\"strong\">Doesn't have to</span>\".<br/> <br/>Structure:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>You/We/I/They <br/>She/He </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ auxiliary in negative<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">don't <br/>doesn't</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Examples: <br/>You <span class=\"strong\">don't</span> <span class=\"italic\">have</span> to eat just a little bit or eat only salads. <br/> She <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span> <span class=\"italic\">have</span> to watch her portions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u201cGoing to have to\u201d also expresses a necessary action in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm gonna have to cut down on my coffee. </span><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to have to invest in a small machine.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It's also used as a conditional for a resulting action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Because I'm on a tight budget, I'm going to have to cook more often at home. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " How much did you use to have?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " \u201c<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span>\u201d and \u201c<span class=\"strong\">would</span>\u201d express an action that occurred regularly in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "But: <br/>Only \"<span class=\"strong\">used to</span>\" expresses repeated habits in the past. <br/>Only \"<span class=\"strong\">would</span>\" is more formal and sentimental.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">used to</span> + verb in basic form (infinitive) + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">would</span> + verb in basic form (infinitive) + complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Examples:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Pattern with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">used</span> to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Pattern with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I used to drink 6 cups of coffee a day.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would spend a lot of money at the cafe.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Now I have only 3 cups of coffee a day.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" My family used to cook a lot at birthday parties.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would end up ingesting a lot of oily food.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I enjoy the food, but I don't have too much of it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to saut\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pan fry food with a small amount of oil ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to saut\u00e9 vegetables with my dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about cooking and diet.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cut down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to reduce on the amount you use or consume", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've gotta cut down on the sweets and fries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to go through", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use a certain amount of something in a period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We go through a quart of skim milk a week at home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to ingest", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to eat or swallow", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: At birthday parties and festivals, I would ingest a lot of deep-fried foods.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to burn (energy or calories)", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to expend, to use up or spend", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're going to have to burn those calories because you ate so much. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "calorie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a unit used to measure the amount of energy that foods will produce in the body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to eat more low calorie foods to not gain weight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le03ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "You are going to plan the celebration meal for your next birthday.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the dish you would like your family to make for you and the ingredients necessary for that dish. Write the whole menu plan in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include healthy but tasty food in your menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show the menu plan to your family. Keep it until your birthday.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I describe how food is prepared. I express quantity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write the names of foods in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include nutritious foods in my menu plan.", "type": "text"}]}]}